# install.cmd and install.bat are downloaded RAW (curl / zip) and executed
# by cmd.exe, which misparses LF-only files inside (...) blocks. The git
# BLOB itself must therefore be CRLF - raw.githubusercontent.com serves the
# blob, not a checkout, so `eol=crlf` would NOT fix downloads (it
# normalizes back to LF on commit). `-text` disables all conversion so the
# committed CRLF bytes survive; `diff` keeps diffs readable as text.
*.cmd -text diff
*.bat -text diff
